PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48B5

   1 a 0000 E48B5:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1 r2] TWO STATIC BITS, no automatics: does the
   4 a 0006      static section charge 2, or 1 (last-cell-wins)?  E20B/E20D
   5 a 0006      pinned one static only. */
